   - ui_code_editor, ui_richtext, ui_tree, ui_htmlview\n  [26] Office & Data Plugins      - excel_write, docx_create, graph_line\n  [27] Core Language Edge Cases   - dot notation, string indexing, list concatenation\n\nTOTAL: 27 test groups, 500+ individual assertions\n\nLAYOUT: Absolute positioning (x, y, w, h) - no sizer-based layout\nWIDGETS: Panel, Label, Entry, Button, Text, Checkbox, Radio, ComboBox,\n         ListView, Sheet, Tabs, DatePicker, Tree, HTMLView, CodeEditor, RichText\n"
